    subset-surface compile closure and HostModuleCheckCompilePathErasureTerm after
    reading the real lakefile. Bad compiles a temp
    HostModuleCheckCompilePathErasureTerm copy with a planted type error after Mult
    and the HostFront / HostGraph / SubsetEmit / HostPackageWrite /
    HostPackageWriteTheorems / HostPackageRoots /
